WEBVTT

00:02.480 --> 00:07.390
<i></i>Revolution<i>: a dating sim that 
takes place at the Royal Academy,</i>

00:07.390 --> 00:10.610
<i>in which the player can enjoy romantic 
encounters with three princes.</i>

00:11.980 --> 00:14.990
<i>And my favorite character 
in this otome game is...</i>

00:14.990 --> 00:16.400
Miss Claire!

00:20.060 --> 00:22.600
I love you, Miss Claire!

00:23.440 --> 00:25.370
<i>Claire François.</i>

00:25.370 --> 00:27.540
<i>The mean-spirited rich girl who torments</i>

00:27.540 --> 00:31.310
<i>the heroine, her rival, but has the 
tables turned on her in the end.</i>

00:31.310 --> 00:32.010
<i>She's what they call...</i>

00:32.860 --> 00:34.790
<i>a villainess.</i>

02:05.980 --> 02:10.980
<b>Episode 1</b>

02:05.980 --> 02:10.980
<b>Rushing Headlong into Life in Another World</b>

02:11.840 --> 02:15.990
<i>I, Oohashi Rei, was an employee 
at a small business.</i>

02:16.410 --> 02:19.300
<i>I had finished another day 
of exploitative overtime,</i>

02:17.740 --> 02:24.250
<i>Ugh! Since when did this academy 
admit such low-born peasants?</i>

02:19.300 --> 02:22.560
<i>and was immersing myself 
in my preferred video game...</i>

02:22.560 --> 02:24.250
<i>Or so I thought.</i>

02:24.250 --> 02:26.000
<i>How deplorable.</i>

02:24.250 --> 02:29.670
<b>Claire</b>

02:24.250 --> 02:29.670
<b>How deplorable. You expect me to sit in class with someone like this?</b>

02:26.000 --> 02:29.880
<i>You expect me to sit in class 
with someone like this?</i>

02:30.170 --> 02:31.280
<i>But...</i>

02:31.710 --> 02:33.880
Open your eyes at once!

02:33.880 --> 02:35.380
This is not funny at all!

02:35.920 --> 02:38.160
Excuse me! Are you listening?!

02:39.480 --> 02:42.430
<i>The next thing I knew, 
she was right in front of me...</i>

02:42.430 --> 02:46.130
A mere commoner has the nerve 
to share a desk with me?

02:44.390 --> 02:47.350
<b>m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100</b>

02:44.390 --> 02:47.350
<b>Claire François</b>

02:46.130 --> 02:48.150
Know your place!

02:49.590 --> 02:50.770
Claire?

02:50.770 --> 02:54.970
My word! You dare address me 
by my name alone?!

02:55.470 --> 02:56.240
<i>Huh?</i>

02:56.700 --> 02:57.490
<i>What?!</i>

02:58.170 --> 02:59.620
<i>This is...</i>

03:00.410 --> 03:02.490
<i>just like in the game...</i>

03:03.810 --> 03:05.000
Miss Claire!

03:05.000 --> 03:06.120
Yes, that's right!

03:06.120 --> 03:09.130
A commoner like you must address me 
with an honorific title.

03:09.130 --> 03:12.170
Do you remember my name?

03:13.490 --> 03:15.050
Are you mocking me,

03:15.050 --> 03:18.970
<b>m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100</b>

03:15.050 --> 03:18.970
<b>Rae Taylor</b>

03:15.540 --> 03:16.990
Rae Taylor?

03:16.990 --> 03:20.040
<i>"Taylor" is the family name 
of the game's protagonist,</i>

03:20.040 --> 03:23.040
<i>and "Rae" is the given name I put in... so...</i>

03:23.040 --> 03:24.630
<i>Does this mean what I think it means?!</i>

03:24.630 --> 03:26.850
<i>Was I really, actually...</i>

03:27.270 --> 03:30.630
<i>reincarnated in another world?!</i>

03:32.580 --> 03:33.670
I love you.

03:33.670 --> 03:34.420
Huh?

03:35.360 --> 03:38.360
I love you, Miss Claire!

03:38.700 --> 03:40.620
Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh—

03:41.100 --> 03:43.910
What in the world are you saying?!

03:43.910 --> 03:47.750
What do you mean? I'm just 
saying I love you, that's all.

03:48.430 --> 03:51.870
Hmph! It will do you no good 
to try to curry favor with me.

03:51.870 --> 03:56.760
I will never be even the slightest bit 
cordial with a mere commoner!

03:57.230 --> 03:59.410
You're so cute.

04:00.380 --> 04:03.140
Oh, I'm sorry. My real thoughts slipped out.

04:03.140 --> 04:06.020
You're just so adorably cute...

04:06.020 --> 04:09.020
J-Just who are you, anyway?!

04:09.350 --> 04:12.490
You hate me, don't you, Miss Claire?

04:12.490 --> 04:14.650
O-Obviously.

04:14.650 --> 04:18.870
And that's okay! Keep the bullying coming!

04:18.870 --> 04:20.280
I welcome it!

04:22.420 --> 04:26.780
Well, I guess this is the start of our 
super-fun school life, Miss Claire!

04:26.780 --> 04:28.950
Let's enjoy it to the fullest together!

04:28.950 --> 04:34.000
Why do you assume I'll have 
anything to do with you?!

04:38.880 --> 04:40.210
Rae?

04:40.210 --> 04:43.010
Oh, dear. I'm so very sorry.

04:43.010 --> 04:46.430
Since you were just staring into space, 
I thought you were a decoration.

04:48.530 --> 04:50.080
Miss Claire...

04:50.080 --> 04:53.690
What? Don't waste your time 
waiting for an apology.

04:53.690 --> 04:55.770
That was magnificent!

04:56.200 --> 05:00.010
You have flunkies, but you're willing 
to get your own hands dirty!

05:00.010 --> 05:03.320
You really are leagues ahead 
of those run-of-the-mill bullies!

05:03.320 --> 05:05.030
Wh-What are you—

05:05.370 --> 05:07.790
I love you, Miss Claire!

05:12.040 --> 05:15.540
Oh, dear! I thought it was 
a bug, so I stepped on it!

05:16.270 --> 05:17.430
...arder.

05:17.430 --> 05:19.440
I can't hear you, commoner!

05:19.440 --> 05:21.800
If there's something you 
want to say, say it clear—

05:22.180 --> 05:24.800
If you're gonna step on me, step harder!

05:25.660 --> 05:28.610
I could tell you were 
holding back with that stomp!

05:28.610 --> 05:32.440
What reason does someone 
like you have to hold back?!

05:32.830 --> 05:35.290
Huh? My textbook is gone.

05:35.290 --> 05:36.860
What's the matter?

05:37.180 --> 05:40.360
Are commoners so poor that they 
can't even afford textbooks?

05:41.110 --> 05:45.870
I'm so sorry. I didn't realize how you felt.

05:47.700 --> 05:50.220
If you had just behaved 
so nicely from the start—

05:50.220 --> 05:54.920
You wanted to sit closer to me during 
class so badly that you'd hide my textbook?!

05:54.920 --> 05:56.040
Huh?!

05:56.040 --> 05:58.560
We <i>are</i> seat neighbors, after all!

05:58.560 --> 06:01.110
Let's get cozy and look at yours together!

06:01.110 --> 06:03.810
Wha... You are making zero sense!

06:07.170 --> 06:10.810
Honestly, Rae, what are you thinking?

06:08.600 --> 06:10.810
<b>m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100</b>

06:08.600 --> 06:10.810
<b>Misha Jur</b>

06:11.230 --> 06:13.930
And right after the school year started, too.

06:13.930 --> 06:16.560
It's no surprise Miss Claire's 
got her eye on you now.

06:17.760 --> 06:19.940
I wouldn't say she has her eye on me.

06:19.940 --> 06:22.400
More like I was trying to <i>get</i> her eyes on me.

06:23.390 --> 06:27.080
Rae, I have to warn you as your roommate.

06:27.080 --> 06:29.660
You'd best not get involved with Miss Claire.

06:30.170 --> 06:32.910
Her family, the house of François,

06:32.910 --> 06:35.670
is one of the most prestigious 
families in the Bauer Kingdom.

06:35.940 --> 06:39.290
There's nothing she couldn't do 
to you if she really wanted to.

06:39.730 --> 06:42.050
You're such a worrywart, Misha.

06:43.890 --> 06:47.960
I come from a ruined noble family. 
We've been through a lot.

06:47.960 --> 06:49.680
But you know, Misha...

06:49.990 --> 06:52.810
I love Miss Claire.

06:52.810 --> 06:55.310
A self-serving princess like her?

06:55.780 --> 07:00.040
That cackling laugh, all the nasty deeds 
she does out of pure malice...

07:00.040 --> 07:03.530
Everything about her is right up my alley!

07:03.530 --> 07:06.320
You really are an oddball, aren't you?

07:08.240 --> 07:12.450
Miss Claire may be a bully, 
but there's a line she'll never cross.

07:13.060 --> 07:15.990
When she pushed me over, she did it 
in the hallway where it was safe.

07:15.990 --> 07:18.960
And she only hid my textbook. 
She didn't throw it away.

07:19.300 --> 07:20.710
Plus...

07:20.710 --> 07:23.150
Miss Claire, please trust us.

07:23.150 --> 07:25.970
We can take care of that commoner 
for you from now on.

07:26.590 --> 07:27.970
Absolutely not.

07:30.830 --> 07:35.870
I will personally make 
that commoner submit to me.

07:36.180 --> 07:40.690
Miss Claire only gets her own 
hands dirty with her bullying.

07:41.110 --> 07:43.210
That unnecessary amount of pride she has,

07:43.210 --> 07:46.730
the way she tries to hide her real 
fragility behind intimidation...

07:48.040 --> 07:51.350
I just can't bring myself to dislike 
that human side of her!

07:51.700 --> 07:55.990
All those things just make her 
irresistibly cute to me!

08:01.460 --> 08:03.140
Oh, what's this?

08:03.140 --> 08:05.070
You haven't found a partner?

08:05.070 --> 08:06.660
This is why you lowly commoners—

08:06.660 --> 08:10.420
Teacher! Miss Claire says 
she'll be my partner!

08:10.420 --> 08:12.180
I will <i>not</i>!

08:15.350 --> 08:18.390
You're so filthy, I thought 
you were a pile of mud!

08:18.390 --> 08:20.620
Eek! Don't touch me!

08:20.620 --> 08:23.400
Miss Claire, please warm me up.

08:26.740 --> 08:30.340
Is this... from you, Miss Claire?

08:31.160 --> 08:33.130
It's my first gift from you!

08:33.130 --> 08:35.100
I'll press it and carry it around with me!

08:35.100 --> 08:37.160
Why would you think to do that?!

08:38.360 --> 08:41.170
Don't you think...

08:41.590 --> 08:44.040
you're a little bit too resilient?

08:44.540 --> 08:47.010
Huh? What do you mean?

08:50.740 --> 08:54.930
How can you remain so calm 
throughout all this bullying?!

08:54.930 --> 08:57.810
Bullying? It's out of love, isn't it?

08:57.810 --> 08:58.980
It is <i>not</i>!

08:58.980 --> 09:00.940
What is it, then?!

09:00.940 --> 09:03.660
Why are you the one getting angry at me?!

09:03.660 --> 09:06.730
Commoners should just keep quiet 
and devote themselves to hard labor!

09:06.990 --> 09:10.420
Adoring you, Miss Claire, is my hard labor!

09:10.420 --> 09:12.200
Nay, it is my service to you!

09:14.820 --> 09:16.750
I can't take any more of this girl!

09:16.750 --> 09:19.140
Miss Claire! You mustn't lose heart!

09:19.140 --> 09:21.460
Perseverance makes one stronger, you know!

09:27.120 --> 09:28.840
Miss Claire?

09:29.520 --> 09:30.780
You sure about this?

09:30.780 --> 09:32.070
If you're too persistent,

09:32.070 --> 09:35.470
even Miss Claire won't want to give 
you the time of day anymore.

09:36.600 --> 09:38.470
I don't want that!

09:38.470 --> 09:43.970
What am I gonna do if Miss Claire 
stops bullying me, Misha?!

09:44.730 --> 09:46.440
Well...

09:46.440 --> 09:49.870
I guess you should become 
someone that she can't ignore.

09:49.870 --> 09:50.740
Huh?

09:51.080 --> 09:56.000
I mean, she's the kind of person who has 
to be number one at everything, right?

09:56.740 --> 09:58.190
<i>That's it!</i>

09:59.210 --> 10:01.190
<i>If I act just like we would in the game,</i>

10:01.190 --> 10:04.340
<i>the highly competitive Miss Claire 
won't be able to ignore me,</i>

10:04.340 --> 10:06.780
<i>and I'll get to admire her all I want!</i>

10:06.780 --> 10:09.220
<i>Could this relationship 
be any more win-win?!</i>

10:10.390 --> 10:12.890
<i>It's been almost a week 
since the school term started.</i>

10:13.480 --> 10:17.380
<i>These days spent playing with 
Miss Claire are the ultimate bliss!</i>

10:28.650 --> 10:30.490
Miss Claire!

10:31.140 --> 10:32.980
Good day to you, Miss Claire!

10:32.980 --> 10:34.280
Stop right there, commoner!

10:34.650 --> 10:36.800
Don't act so friendly toward her.

10:36.800 --> 10:39.390
You and Miss Claire live 
in completely different worl—

10:39.390 --> 10:42.460
Oh, sorry. I don't have any 
business with her flunkies.

10:42.460 --> 10:43.540
Well!

10:43.950 --> 10:47.120
So anyway, good day to you, Miss Claire!

10:47.120 --> 10:49.290
Don't get so full of yourself.

10:49.290 --> 10:52.120
I have nothing to say to you.

10:52.450 --> 10:56.470
Besides, "good day" is what you say 
when you part ways with someone.

10:56.470 --> 10:58.460
But you still talked to me!

10:58.460 --> 11:00.920
You even corrected my mistake for me!

11:00.920 --> 11:01.890
I love you!

11:01.890 --> 11:03.890
Enough of this!

11:03.890 --> 11:05.890
You've been saying things 
like that for days now!

11:05.890 --> 11:07.900
Cease your ridiculous jokes!

11:08.400 --> 11:10.830
Leave this academy right now!

11:10.830 --> 11:12.270
You're an eyesore!

11:13.180 --> 11:15.020
Hey, now.

11:15.400 --> 11:18.030
You girls have a lot of energy 
so early in the day.

11:18.430 --> 11:21.170
<i>I was so uninterested, I completely forgot.</i>

11:21.170 --> 11:23.470
<i>This is an otome game world!</i>

11:25.190 --> 11:27.710
<i>The first prince, Rod Bauer...</i>

11:25.330 --> 11:27.710
<b>m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100</b>

11:25.330 --> 11:27.710
<b>First Prince      Rod Bauer</b>

11:29.030 --> 11:31.620
<i>The second prince, Thane Bauer...</i>

11:29.460 --> 11:31.630
<b>m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100</b>

11:29.460 --> 11:31.630
<b>Second Prince    Thane Bauer</b>

11:32.700 --> 11:35.190
<i>And the third prince, Yu Bauer.</i>

11:33.380 --> 11:35.550
<b>m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100</b>

11:33.380 --> 11:35.550
<b>Third Prince      Yu Bauer</b>

11:35.910 --> 11:39.820
<i>They're the princes of the Bauer Kingdom, 
where the game takes place.</i>

11:39.820 --> 11:43.060
<i>In other words, they're the actual 
romance routes in the game.</i>

11:43.380 --> 11:45.970
What's goin' on here? Something fun?

11:45.970 --> 11:47.310
Let me in on it.

11:47.730 --> 11:49.110
Prince Rod!

11:49.110 --> 11:51.990
There's nothing fun going on at all.

11:52.390 --> 11:56.950
There's just one person here who brings 
disorder to this academy. That is all.

11:56.950 --> 12:00.820
Are you saying you want to 
be disorderly with me?

12:00.820 --> 12:02.450
I do <i>not</i>!

12:03.590 --> 12:05.210
Rae Taylor, wasn't it?

12:05.210 --> 12:08.210
She's the highest ranked among this 
year's new students, right, Misha?

12:08.750 --> 12:12.670
Yes, Prince Yu. She and I attended 
the same elementary school.

12:12.670 --> 12:16.530
She's definitely not the kinda girl 
who usually hangs out with nobles.

12:16.530 --> 12:21.860
And her dad's ideas about meritocracy 
had a pretty hilarious ending, too.

12:22.340 --> 12:23.550
Thane.

12:23.550 --> 12:25.630
C'mon, join us.

12:25.630 --> 12:27.060
I'll pass.

12:27.860 --> 12:29.590
Prince Thane...

12:30.600 --> 12:33.600
Miss Claire, why don't you go talk to him?

12:33.600 --> 12:36.200
What?! Wh-Why should I...

12:36.200 --> 12:38.070
Well, you like him, don't you?

12:38.820 --> 12:43.900
<i>Yes, the one Miss Claire has 
feelings for is Prince Thane.</i>

12:44.280 --> 12:45.720
Right?

12:45.720 --> 12:49.540
Wh-Wh-Wh-What are you talking about?!

12:49.540 --> 12:51.420
<i>Oops... It slipped out...</i>

12:52.260 --> 12:55.580
<i>But she looks so cute 
when she's all flustered!</i>

12:56.060 --> 12:57.820
Y-You're wrong!

12:57.820 --> 13:01.180
I have no interest 
in Prince Thane whatsoever!

13:04.560 --> 13:06.560
I-I didn't mean...

13:09.340 --> 13:12.610
Looks like you got shot down hard, Thane.

13:15.190 --> 13:17.940
<i>Oh, man! I really blew it!</i>

13:18.550 --> 13:22.970
<i>Prince Thane has always been outshone 
by his two talented brothers,</i>

13:22.970 --> 13:27.830
<i>and he's super insecure about it. 
He's a tough guy to deal with.</i>

13:27.830 --> 13:31.330
<b>The Three Princes: Squeeability ♥ Ranking</b>

13:27.830 --> 13:31.330
<b>The Princeliest Prince</b>

13:27.830 --> 13:31.330
<b>The Difficult One</b>

13:27.830 --> 13:31.330
<b>Me, Me, Me</b>

13:28.310 --> 13:30.680
<i>I don't dislike him, though.</i>

13:33.330 --> 13:37.670
What have you done?! How could 
you tell Prince Thane that—

13:37.670 --> 13:39.980
Let's go apologize, Miss Claire.

13:39.980 --> 13:42.300
Prince Thane is a sensitive guy.

13:42.620 --> 13:45.670
What would a commoner know about anything?!

13:45.670 --> 13:47.610
Whose fault do you think—

13:48.780 --> 13:50.270
Let's go apologize.

13:51.270 --> 13:53.060
This is none of your business!

13:53.410 --> 13:55.560
I won't stand for this any longer!

13:57.310 --> 14:03.570
If this is how it must be, I'll keep 
bullying you until you submit to me in tears!

14:03.570 --> 14:06.320
Prepare yourself, Rae Taylor!

14:06.320 --> 14:09.570
I will never give up, no matter what!

14:13.270 --> 14:15.080
Water would be too tame.

14:15.500 --> 14:17.720
Maybe I should dump tea on her?

14:17.720 --> 14:19.960
But boiling liquid would be too...

14:21.270 --> 14:25.420
Miss Claire, why don't you just 
put that commoner out of your mind?

14:25.420 --> 14:27.590
The more you bully her, 
the more she likes it.

14:27.590 --> 14:29.470
It's kind of creepy.

14:29.470 --> 14:30.850
No! I will not stop!

14:37.030 --> 14:38.780
What's this? Studying?

14:38.780 --> 14:41.100
Well, our exams are tomorrow.

14:41.100 --> 14:43.620
Oh, don't remind me!

14:43.620 --> 14:47.090
Exams just a week after 
the school term started?

14:48.660 --> 14:50.230
That's it!

14:51.460 --> 14:52.910
Rae Taylor.

14:54.790 --> 14:57.790
Let's see which of us performs 
better on tomorrow's exams.

14:58.390 --> 15:02.420
If I win, you will leave this academy.

15:02.420 --> 15:04.400
Huh? I don't want to, though.

15:05.050 --> 15:08.550
W-Would you at least 
think it over for one second?!

15:08.550 --> 15:12.810
I mean, there's not really 
anything in it for me.

15:13.450 --> 15:17.610
And if I leave the academy, 
I won't be able to play with you.

15:17.610 --> 15:19.750
I don't like your idea of "playing with" me!

15:19.750 --> 15:22.820
Don't use phrases with 
double meanings like that!

15:23.130 --> 15:24.950
Just agree to this contest with me!

15:24.950 --> 15:27.650
Or does the top-ranked new 
student intend to run away?!

15:28.210 --> 15:31.200
All right, then. Let's do this.

15:31.730 --> 15:36.640
But if you don't win, you have 
to do one thing I ask of you.

15:36.640 --> 15:39.210
What? Why must I do that?

15:39.210 --> 15:41.530
Oh, are you running away?

15:41.530 --> 15:44.090
The top-ranked student among 
the Royal Academy's affiliates?

15:45.440 --> 15:47.710
Are you trying to provoke me?

15:47.710 --> 15:50.090
Very well. I'll take you on.

15:50.090 --> 15:51.760
Yay!

15:51.760 --> 15:55.470
Misha, you will be the witness 
to this competition.

15:57.140 --> 15:58.850
Is that okay with you, Rae?

15:59.330 --> 16:00.540
Of course!

16:03.470 --> 16:05.170
Then make your vows.

16:05.920 --> 16:07.590
I swear to God!

16:16.490 --> 16:18.880
<i>Culture, history, literature...</i>

16:18.880 --> 16:21.420
<i>General subjects that aren't directly 
connected to day-to-day life</i>

16:21.420 --> 16:22.880
<i>are where nobles reign supreme!</i>

16:23.910 --> 16:26.950
<i>In other words, I have the 
overwhelming advantage!</i>

16:26.950 --> 16:29.180
<i>I'm winning these exams!</i>

16:29.630 --> 16:31.640
The exams will now begin!

16:37.140 --> 16:40.020
<i>Oh, yeah, I remember doing this.</i>

16:40.840 --> 16:43.310
<i>After all the hours 
I spent grinding in this game,</i>

16:43.310 --> 16:47.280
<i>I've already experienced 
this event plenty of times.</i>

16:47.740 --> 16:50.670
<i>For someone as serious 
about the game as I've been,</i>

16:50.670 --> 16:53.280
<i>these exams are like 
taking candy from a baby.</i>

16:54.030 --> 16:56.740
<b>Second Exam:  Etiquette</b>

16:55.010 --> 16:58.660
<i>Table manners are hard when 
you're physically doing it.</i>

16:58.660 --> 17:02.290
<i>It was easy in the game because 
it was all multiple choice.</i>

17:03.700 --> 17:08.170
<i>Having the skills naturally because you've 
been doing it all your life helps a lot.</i>

17:08.170 --> 17:11.180
<i>Nobles have a huge advantage here.</i>

17:14.230 --> 17:16.340
<i>Sh-She's too beautiful!</i>

17:17.500 --> 17:20.810
<i>Miss Claire! You never disappoint! 
I love you!</i>

17:20.810 --> 17:23.310
<i>I want to burn this image into my retinas!</i>

17:23.310 --> 17:25.910
<i>Rae Taylor loses points.</i>

17:26.820 --> 17:29.300
We'll start by assessing 
your basic magic ability,

17:27.360 --> 17:30.530
<b>Final Exam: Magic Ability</b>

17:29.300 --> 17:32.320
followed by your use of magic tools.

17:32.610 --> 17:34.790
In the basic magic exam,

17:34.790 --> 17:38.330
we will evaluate your attributes 
as well as your aptitude.

17:38.810 --> 17:43.860
There are four attributes: 
earth, water, fire, and wind.

17:43.860 --> 17:47.840
In general, one person 
can possess one attribute.

17:47.840 --> 17:49.720
Aptitude is expressed in five levels:

17:47.840 --> 17:54.840
<b>Exceptional</b>

17:47.840 --> 17:54.840
<b>High</b>

17:47.840 --> 17:54.840
<b>Intermediate</b>

17:47.840 --> 17:54.840
<b>Low</b>

17:47.840 --> 17:54.840
<b>Nonexistent</b>

17:49.720 --> 17:54.840
exceptional, high, intermediate, 
low, and nonexistent.

18:00.850 --> 18:03.380
Amazing! You've done it again, Miss Claire!

18:03.380 --> 18:05.730
I can't believe you have high 
aptitude in the fire attribute!

18:07.550 --> 18:08.940
But of course!

18:08.940 --> 18:11.430
My, what a lively group.

18:12.090 --> 18:13.660
Did you just—

18:13.660 --> 18:15.200
I put my hand over it!

18:15.480 --> 18:19.200
Those who have been graded can 
move on to the magic tool exam.

18:23.680 --> 18:25.750
Prince Rod!

18:26.300 --> 18:28.470
You look like you're having fun, Rod.

18:28.470 --> 18:30.630
Oh, hey, Yu.

18:30.630 --> 18:32.170
Done with your exams?

18:32.170 --> 18:33.630
Yep. Done and dusted.

18:34.270 --> 18:35.750
What about Thane?

18:41.270 --> 18:43.890
Boy, he's in a bad mood.

18:44.370 --> 18:47.270
Apparently he struggled with 
the general curriculum exam.

18:47.270 --> 18:49.770
Next, Rae Taylor!

18:50.230 --> 18:52.220
Hey, that's...

18:52.220 --> 18:54.530
The girl who was with Misha before.

19:04.000 --> 19:06.450
Oh, well done.

19:06.450 --> 19:10.000
She was a little off the mark, 
but she has good intuition.

19:10.000 --> 19:12.500
No... That was...

19:14.910 --> 19:16.370
<i>She moved it?</i>

19:17.720 --> 19:19.380
Fascinating.

19:19.380 --> 19:20.620
Miss Claire!

19:20.620 --> 19:22.320
Rae Taylor, eh?

19:22.320 --> 19:26.350
Oh? It's unusual for you to commit 
someone's name to your memory.

19:26.350 --> 19:27.270
Yeah.

19:28.690 --> 19:31.690
Are you tired? Shall I 
massage your shoulders?

19:29.480 --> 19:31.030
She's got me interested.

19:33.080 --> 19:34.690
I'm exhausted...

19:35.440 --> 19:39.450
And just what do you want at this hour?

19:39.450 --> 19:43.580
After a full day of exams, 
I'm worn out in both body and soul...

19:43.970 --> 19:45.950
So I came to replenish my energy!

19:45.950 --> 19:48.960
Please give me a goodnight hug!

19:54.110 --> 19:56.470
You're certainly in a good mood, Miss Claire.

19:57.520 --> 19:59.550
Does it look that way to you, Lene?

19:59.550 --> 20:03.130
Yes. Is there something you're
looking forward to today?

20:03.740 --> 20:07.770
The results from our recent exams 
will be announced today.

20:08.900 --> 20:10.610
Oh, dear, commoner!

20:11.110 --> 20:13.000
You have bags under your eyes.

20:13.000 --> 20:14.740
Oh, Miss Claire!

20:14.740 --> 20:17.600
Yeah, I didn't get 
a wink of sleep last night.

20:19.440 --> 20:21.400
Oh, you poor thing!

20:21.400 --> 20:26.120
You were so worried you'd lose 
to me that you couldn't sleep?

20:26.120 --> 20:30.280
Well, I was trying to decide 
what I'd ask you to do,

20:30.280 --> 20:32.330
and suddenly, it was morning.

20:32.330 --> 20:34.210
<i>That's</i> why?!

20:41.470 --> 20:44.470
I will now announce 
the results of your exams.

20:44.970 --> 20:47.330
First, the general curriculum exam.

20:45.970 --> 20:48.480
<b>General Curriculum Exam Results</b>

20:45.970 --> 20:48.480
<b>1st   Rod Bauer             (100 pts.)</b>

20:45.970 --> 20:48.480
<b>2nd  Yu Bauer               (98 pts.)</b>

20:45.970 --> 20:48.480
<b>3rd   Rae Taylor            (98 pts.)</b>

20:45.970 --> 20:48.480
<b>4th   Claire François     (95 pts.)</b>

20:45.970 --> 20:48.480
<b>7th   Misha Jur              (90 pts.)</b>

20:45.970 --> 20:48.480
<b>10th Thane Bauer         (87 pts.)</b>

20:49.730 --> 20:54.310
Oh? It's no surprise Yu and I 
took the top two, but...

20:54.310 --> 20:55.870
Not a bad showing, Rae.

20:55.870 --> 20:57.690
Thank you!

20:58.130 --> 21:03.090
Unbelievable! How could 
I lose to a commoner?

21:03.090 --> 21:05.270
<i>Sorry, Miss Claire.</i>

21:05.270 --> 21:08.450
<i>I've done more than just sink 
all my time into the game.</i>

21:08.890 --> 21:11.450
<i>I put out a doujinshi, too!</i>

21:11.980 --> 21:16.460
<i>It's a villainess story about Miss Claire 
falling from grace and rising back up!</i>

21:16.460 --> 21:19.150
<i>I needed to understand the game's 
world and the age it takes place in,</i>

21:16.460 --> 21:23.220
<b></b>The World of <i>Revolution</i>

21:19.150 --> 21:22.840
<i>so I read all the books on its 
setting from cover to cover!</i>

21:23.220 --> 21:27.230
<i>Frankly, I'm pretty sure I know more 
about it than the staff that made it!</i>

21:27.790 --> 21:30.920
Next, the etiquette exam results.

21:28.770 --> 21:31.230
<b>Etiquette Exam Results</b>

21:28.770 --> 21:31.230
<b>1st   Yu Bauer                 (100 pts.)</b>

21:28.770 --> 21:31.230
<b>2nd  Rod Bauer               (98 pts.)</b>

21:28.770 --> 21:31.230
<b>3rd   Claire François       (97 pts.)</b>

21:28.770 --> 21:31.230
<b>4th   Thane Bauer           (95 pts.)</b>

21:28.770 --> 21:31.230
<b>8th   Misha Jur                (90 pts.)</b>

21:28.770 --> 21:31.230
<b>22nd  Rae Taylor               (75 pts.)</b>

21:33.210 --> 21:35.850
I knew that last one was pure dumb luck!

21:35.850 --> 21:38.730
Your mask has fallen off now, commoner!

21:39.070 --> 21:41.150
<i>Miss Claire's all excited...</i>

21:41.150 --> 21:43.240
<i>That's so cute!</i>

21:43.240 --> 21:46.990
Finally, the results 
of the magic ability exam.

21:49.090 --> 21:53.000
Now, pay close attention. 
These are your final moments.

21:55.290 --> 21:58.750
<b>Magic Ability Exam Results</b>

21:55.290 --> 21:58.750
<b>1st   Rae Taylor    (Unmeasurable)</b>

21:55.290 --> 21:58.750
<b>2nd  Misha Jur                   (98 pts.)</b>

21:55.290 --> 21:58.750
<b>6th   Claire François          (92 pts.)</b>

21:55.290 --> 21:58.750
<b>8th   Thane Bauer             (90 pts.)</b>

21:55.290 --> 21:58.750
<b>9th   Rod Bauer                 (88 pts.)</b>

21:55.290 --> 21:58.750
<b>9th   Yu Bauer                   (88 pts.)</b>

22:06.260 --> 22:09.260
<b>1st   Rae Taylor</b>

22:06.580 --> 22:09.260
First place... Rae Taylor?

22:10.000 --> 22:12.380
"Unmeasurable"?!

23:46.480 --> 23:47.640
Miss Claire!

23:47.640 --> 23:49.410
Why are you following me?!

23:49.410 --> 23:53.250
You need me within reach so you 
can bully me as much as possible!

23:53.250 --> 23:56.000
By the way, I found a great part-time job!

23:56.000 --> 23:58.490
Well, good for you. 
You'd best work hard, then.

23:58.490 --> 24:00.430
Wait, wh-what?!

23:59.500 --> 24:01.010
<b>Episode 2</b>

23:59.500 --> 24:01.010
<b>A Maid's Job Is a Labor of Love</b>
